flowchart TB
 UPS[Power / UPS] --> PC[Windows Control Workstation]
 PC --> HAL[Hardware Abstraction Layer]
 HAL --> SIM[Virtual Machine Simulator]
 HAL --> ADAPTER[Authorized Vendor Adapter Plugin]
 ADAPTER --> CTRL[Vendor Machine Controller]
 CTRL --> STAGE[Stage / Motion]
 CTRL --> OPTICS[Optics / Exposure]
 CTRL --> SENSORS[Sensors / Metrology]
